00:16:18,310 --> 00:16:24,790
They had bus numbers and at one point there was an addition.

231
00:16:24,790 --> 00:16:28,949
where one bus number was added to another bus number and of course that was not the intent.

232
00:16:28,949 --> 00:16:33,829
It was two other things, but someone had just mistaken two parameters for each other.

233
00:16:33,829 --> 00:16:39,990
And ended up adding two bus numbers, coming up with something that looked like a bus number.

234
00:16:39,990 --> 00:16:43,189
But in the end made no sense at all.

235
00:16:43,189 --> 00:16:46,150
And led to very strange behavior a few steps down the line.

236
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:47,910
Also, something that is preventable.

