00:26:45,669 --> 00:26:49,590
or something to it that you can add your products to your order.

377
00:26:49,590 --> 00:26:52,149
But of course you can't add things after a certain time.

378
00:26:52,149 --> 00:26:58,150
Like for instance after you have paid the order you shouldn't be allowed to add new products to. the order.

379
00:26:58,150 --> 00:27:03,510
And because of that you need to make sure that the ad method is protected.

380
00:27:03,510 --> 00:27:08,390
In the sense of does it make sense to add something at this point of time.

381
00:27:08,390 --> 00:27:10,630
so usually many developers tend to forget.

382
00:27:10,630 --> 00:27:16,789
that what they do is that they simply don't call the ad method that's how they protect against. illegal ads which is poor.

383
00:27:16,799 --> 00:27:21,990
And we must say this five rung ladder of input validation to us.

384
00:27:21,990 --> 00:27:28,149
It's a very central thing that then we build a lot on top of.

385
00:27:28,149 --> 00:27:33,430
Like our designs of domain primitives is of course on top of that ladder.

386
00:27:33,430 --> 00:27:37,029
when we talk about consistency of state.

387
00:27:37,029 --> 00:27:39,830
and state evolution it's of course hang on this ladder as well.

